<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
How Long Is Andrew Wiggins’s Contract With the Heat?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Wiggins is in the last year of a four-year extension worth <strong>$109m</strong> that he signed with <a href="/teams/golden-state-warriors/">Golden State</a> in 2022 under Bird rights, fully guaranteed. He exercised the player option on this season on June 29, 2026.</p>
<p>Miami has already agreed a further extension with him, two years and <strong>$33.83m</strong> from 2027-28, with a player option in 2029-30.</p>

