</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Wiggins’s net worth is published at around <strong>$65m</strong> by Celebrity Net Worth. He has earned <strong>$281.56m</strong> in salary alone, so the figure is some way behind what the league has paid him.</p>
<p>He is Canadian and played one season at Kansas. <a href="/teams/cleveland-cavaliers/">Cleveland</a> took him first in 2014 and traded him to <a href="/teams/minnesota-timberwolves/">Minnesota</a> inside two months.</p>

