<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/andrew-wiggins/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/andrew-wiggins/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Are the Heat Paying Andrew Wiggins in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Wiggins earns $30.17m in 2026-27, third at Miami and the last year of his contract. It rises from $28.22m last season. His career earnings reach $281.56m across thirteen seasons. The salary is 14.60% of the club’s $206.62m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Andrew Wiggins Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract ends after this season, and the extension already agreed pays $33.83m across 2027-28 and 2028-29 with a player option after it. He turns 32 next February."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Andrew Wiggins Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $30.17m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Long Is Andrew Wiggins’s Contract With the Heat?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Wiggins is in the last year of a four-year extension worth $109m that he signed with Golden State in 2022 under Bird rights, fully guaranteed. He exercised the player option on this season on June 29, 2026. Miami has already agreed a further extension with him, two years and $33.83m from 2027-28, with a player option in 2029-30."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Andrew Wiggins’s Net Worth in 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Wiggins’s net worth is published at around $65m by Celebrity Net Worth. He has earned $281.56m in salary alone, so the figure is some way behind what the league has paid him. He is Canadian and played one season at Kansas. Cleveland took him first in 2014 and traded him to Minnesota inside two months."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Did the Heat Extend Andrew Wiggins?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Wiggins is paid $30.17m because a first overall pick who became a starter on a championship team keeps a large number long after the draft. He has been paid $281.56m and made one All-Star team."}}]}</script>
